"FontFile.msdf_pixel_range] must be set to at least [i]twice[/i] the value of "
"[theme_item outline_size] for outline rendering to look correct. Otherwise, "
"the outline may appear to be cut off earlier than intended."
msgstr ""
"Méid imlíne an téacs.\n"
"[b]Nóta:[/b] Má tá cló á úsáid le [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field] cumasaithe, ní mór a [comhalta "
"FontFile.msdf_pixel_range] a shocrú go dtí [i] faoi dhó[/i] ar a laghad "
