msgstr ""
"Tarraingíonn ciorcal. Féach freisin [method draw_arc], [method "
"draw_polyline], agus [method draw_polygon].\n"
"Má tá [param líonta] [code]true[/code], líonfar an ciorcal leis an [dath "
