"Má tá [param enable] [code]true[/code], gheobhaidh an nód seo "
"[NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED leanúnach] nuair a athraíonn a "
"chlaochlú áitiúil."

#: doc/classes/CanvasItem.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the node will receive [constant "
