msgstr ""
"Filleann sé eagar ar a bhfuil na hainmneacha tairisigh slánuimhir uile "
"[aicme param] nó a shinsearacht."

#: doc/classes/ClassDB.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of arguments of the method [param method] of [param "
