"maoláin doimhneachta sula rithfear an éifeacht.\n"
"[b]Nóta:[/b] I [method _render_callback], chun an úsáid maoláin réitithe a "
"rochtain:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers : RenderSceneBuffersRD = "
"render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var depth_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"render_buffers\", "
"\"doimhneacht\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"The type of effect that is implemented, determines at what stage of "
