"[b] Nóta:[/b] Cuirtear an modh seo i bhfeidhm ar Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS "
"agus Windows."

#: doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of keyboard layouts.\n"
