"\t\treturn ResourceSaver.Save(mesh, filename);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Chun [EditorImportPlugin] a úsáid, cláraigh é ag baint úsáide as an modh "
