"polygon editors with an opaque gray outline. This outline is displayed while "
"dragging a point until the left mouse button is released."
msgstr ""
"Más rud é [code]true[/code], taispeánann sé cruth an pholagán roimhe seo sna "
"heagarthóirí polagán 2T le imlíne liath teimhneach. Taispeántar an imlíne "
"seo agus tú ag tarraingt pointe go dtí go scaoiltear an cnaipe luiche ar "
"chlé."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
