"Stórálann sé an [Teaghrán] tugtha mar líne sa chomhad i bhformáid Pascal "
"(i.e. stóráil fad na sreinge freisin).\n"
"Ionchódófar an téacs mar UTF-8."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Stores the given [PackedStringArray] in the file as a line formatted in the "
