"delimiter must be one-character long.\n"
"Text will be encoded as UTF-8. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is "
"successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"Stóráil an [PackedStringArray] tugtha sa chomhad mar líne formáidithe san "
"fhormáid CSV (Comma-Sparated Values). Is féidir leat teorannóir difriúil "
"[param delim] a chur ar aghaidh le húsáid seachas an [code]\" "
"réamhshocraithe,\"[/code] (camóg). Caithfidh an teorannóir seo a bheith aon-"
"charachtar ar fad.\n"
"Ionchódófar an téacs mar UTF-8."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Stores a floating-point number as 64 bits in the file. This advances the "
