"number of colors. Colors can be overridden using [FontVariation]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of predefined color palettes. Palette contains all colors "
