"shocrú de láimh.\n"
"[b]Nóta:[/b] Cuirtear an modh seo i bhfeidhm ar macOS agus Windows."

#: doc/classes/NativeMenu.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the item with the specified [param text]. Indices are "
