#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Wraps the [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/html/"
"xrspec.html#XR_KHR_android_thread_settings]XR_KHR_android_thread_settings[/"
"url] extension."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"For XR to be comfortable, it is important for applications to deliver frames "
"quickly and consistently. In order to make sure the important application "
"threads get their full share of time, these threads must be identified to "
"the system, which will adjust their scheduling priority accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the thread type of the given thread, so that the XR runtime can adjust "
"its scheduling priority accordingly.\n"
"[param thread_id] refers to the OS thread id (ie from [code]gettid()[/"
"code]). When [param thread_id] is [code]0[/code], it will set the thread "
"type of the current thread.\n"
"[b]NOTE:[/b] The id returned by [method Thread.get_id] is incompatible with "
"[param thread_id]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Hints to the XR runtime that the thread is doing time critical CPU tasks."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid "Hints to the XR runtime that the thread is doing background CPU tasks."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Hints to the XR runtime that the thread is doing time critical graphics "
"device tasks."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Hints to the XR runtime that the thread is doing background graphics device "
"tasks."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Makes the OpenXR API available for GDExtension."
msgstr "Cuireann sé an API OpenXR ar fáil le haghaidh GDEExtension."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"[OpenXRAPIExtension] makes OpenXR available for GDExtension. It provides the "
"OpenXR API to GDExtension through the [method get_instance_proc_addr] "
"method, and the OpenXR instance through [method get_instance].\n"
"It also provides methods for querying the status of OpenXR initialization, "
"and helper methods for ease of use of the API with GDExtension."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann [OpenXRAPIExtension] OpenXR ar fáil le haghaidh GDE Síneadh. "
"Soláthraíonn sé an API OpenXR go GDExtension tríd an modh [method "
"get_instance_proc_addr], agus an sampla OpenXR trí [method get_instance].\n"
"Soláthraíonn sé freisin modhanna chun stádas thúsaithe OpenXR a cheistiú, "
"agus modhanna cabhrach chun an API le GDExtension a úsáid go héasca."

