"viewport."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé [code]true[/code] má tá OpenXR tosaithe chun é a sholáthar le "
"hamharcphort XR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Marks the end of a debug label region. Removes the latest debug label region "
"added by calling [method begin_debug_label_region]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] corresponding to an [code]Action[/code] of a matching "
"name, optionally limited to a specified action set."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
