msgstr ""
"Filleann sé teaghrán earráide don [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/"
"specs/1.0/man/html/XrResult.html]XrResult[/url] a tugadh."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
