"[code]arr.slice( 1)[/code] is ea gearrlámh do [code]arr.slice(1, arr.size())"
"[/code]).\n"
"Má tá ceachtar [param begin] nó [param end] diúltach, beidh siad i "
"gcoibhneas le deireadh an eagar (i.e. [code]arr.slice(0, -2)[/code] ina "
"gearrshaol le haghaidh [code]arr .slice(0, arr.size() - 2)[/code])."

