"den nód seo. Bogfaidh na nóid sliocht dá réir ansin nuair a bheidh an [dul "
"chun cinn ball] sa nód seo á socrú."

#: doc/classes/PathFollow3D.xml
msgid ""
"Correct the [param transform]. [param rotation_mode] implicitly specifies "
"how posture (forward, up and sideway direction) is calculated."
msgstr ""
"Ceartaigh an [param transform]. Sonraíonn [param rotation_mode] go "
"hintuigthe conas a ríomhtar staidiúir (treo ar aghaidh, suas agus taobh)."

