msgstr ""
"Má chumasaíonn [code]true[/code] tacaíocht [GDEExtension] don leagan "
"gréasáin seo."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Action map configuration to load by default."
msgstr "Cumraíocht léarscáile gnímh le luchtú de réir réamhshocraithe."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], Godot will setup and initialize OpenXR on startup."
