#: doc/classes/ScriptCreateDialog.xml
msgid "Godot editor's popup dialog for creating new [Script] files."
msgstr "Dialóg aníos an eagarthóra Godot chun comhaid [Script] nua a chruthú."

#: doc/classes/ScriptCreateDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The [ScriptCreateDialog] creates script files according to a given template "
"for a given scripting language. The standard use is to configure its fields "
"prior to calling one of the [method Window.popup] methods.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar dialog = ScriptCreateDialog.new();\n"
"\tdialog.config(\"Node\", \"res://new_node.gd\") # For in-engine types.\n"
"\tdialog.config(\"\\\"res://base_node.gd\\\"\", \"res://derived_node.gd\") # "
"For script types.\n"
"\tdialog.popup_centered()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar dialog = new ScriptCreateDialog();\n"
"\tdialog.Config(\"Node\", \"res://NewNode.cs\"); // For in-engine types.\n"
"\tdialog.Config(\"\\\"res://BaseNode.cs\\\"\", \"res://DerivedNode.cs\"); // "
"For script types.\n"
"\tdialog.PopupCentered();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn an [ScriptCreateDialog] comhaid scripte de réir teimpléad tugtha "
"do theanga scriptithe ar leith. Is é an gnáthúsáid ná a réimsí a chumrú "
"roimh ghlaoch ar cheann de na modhanna [method Window.popup].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _réidh():\n"
"\tdialóg var = ScriptCreateDialog.new();\n"
"\tdialog.config (\"Nóid\", \"res://new_node.gd\") # Le haghaidh cineálacha "
"in-inneall.\n"
"\tdialog.config (\"\\\"res://base_node.gd\\\"\", \"res://derived_node.gd\") "
"# Le haghaidh cineálacha scripte.\n"
"\tdialog.popup_centered()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"poiblí a shárú ar neamhní _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tdialóg var = nua ScriptCreateDialog();\n"
"\tdialog.Config(\"Nóid\", \"res://NewNode.cs\"); // Le haghaidh cineálacha "
"in-inneall.\n"
"\tdialog.Config(\"\\\"res://BaseNode.cs\\\"\", \"res://DerivedNode.cs\"); // "
"Le haghaidh cineálacha scripte.\n"
"\tdialóg.PopupCentered();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/ScriptCreateDialog.xml
msgid "Prefills required fields to configure the ScriptCreateDialog for use."
msgstr ""
"Réamhlíonann sé na réimsí riachtanacha chun an ScriptCreateDialog a chumrú "
"le húsáid."

#: doc/classes/ScriptCreateDialog.xml
