"that are already opened."
msgstr ""
"Díchláraítear an [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] ón eagarthóir.\n"
"[b]Nóta:[/b] Cuirfear an [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] i bhfeidhm fós ar "
"scripteanna atá oscailte cheana féin."

