#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"The axes are based on the reference pose's space, if [param axis] is "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_CUSTOM], you can specify any "
"axis.\n"
"In here, the reference pose is the bone pose immediately before the "
"simulation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The rotation axis and the forward vector shouldn't be colinear "
"to avoid unintended rotation since [SpringBoneSimulator3D] does not factor "
"in twisting forces."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the stiffness force at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list "
"when [method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the joint radius of the bone chain. It is used to move and slide with "
"the [SpringBoneCollision3D] in the collision list.\n"
"The value is scaled by [method set_radius_damping_curve] and cached in each "
"joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sets the joint radius damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr "Léiríonn sé méid an [enum HandJoint] enum."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis of the bone chain. If set to a specific axis, it acts "
"like a hinge joint. The value is cached in each joint setting in the joint "
"list.\n"
"The axes are based on the reference pose's space, if [param axis] is "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_CUSTOM], you can specify any "
"axis.\n"
"In here, the reference pose is the bone pose immediately before the "
"simulation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The rotation axis vector and the forward vector shouldn't be "
"colinear to avoid unintended rotation since [SpringBoneSimulator3D] does not "
"factor in twisting forces."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis vector of the bone chain. The value is cached in each "
"joint setting in the joint list.\n"
"This vector is normalized by an internal process and represents the axis "
"around which the bone chain can rotate.\n"
"If the vector length is [code]0[/code], it is considered synonymous with "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the stiffness force of the bone chain. The greater the value, the "
"faster it recovers to its initial pose.\n"
"If [param stiffness] is [code]0[/code], the modified pose will not return to "
"the original pose.\n"
"The value is scaled by [method set_stiffness_damping_curve] and cached in "
"each joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sets the stiffness force damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr "Socraíonn sé maitrís trasfhoirmithe an limistéir."

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"The constant force that always affected bones. It is equal to the result "
"when the parent [Skeleton3D] moves at this speed in the opposite direction.\n"
"This is useful for effects such as wind and anti-gravity."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the solver retrieves the bone axis from the bone pose "
"every frame.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the solver retrieves the bone axis from the bone rest "
"and caches it, which increases performance slightly, but position changes in "
"the bone pose made before processing this [SpringBoneSimulator3D] are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""

