"Windows, UTF-32 ar ardáin eile ) ionchódaithe [ PackedByteArray]. Is é seo "
"an inbhéartach de [method PackedByteArray.get_string_from_wchar]."

#: doc/classes/String.xml doc/classes/StringName.xml
