"Filleann sé [code]true[/code] mura bhfuil an t-ord céanna carachtar sa dá "
"teaghrán."

#: doc/classes/String.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [String] is not equivalent to the given "
"[StringName]."
