#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"[TabBar]s with the same rearrange group ID will allow dragging the tabs "
"between them. Enable drag with [member drag_to_rearrange_enabled].\n"
"Setting this to [code]-1[/code] will disable rearranging between [TabBar]s."
msgstr ""
"Ceadóidh [TabBar]s leis an aitheantas grúpa céanna a athshocrú na cluaisíní "
"a tharraingt eatarthu. Cumasaigh tarraing le [ball "
"drag_to_rearrange_enabled].\n"
"Má shocraítear é seo go [code]-1[/code], díchumasófar atheagrú idir "
"[TabBar]s."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the active tab is rearranged via mouse drag. See [member "
"drag_to_rearrange_enabled]."
msgstr ""
"Astaítear nuair a atheagraítear an cluaisín gníomhach trí tharraingt luiche. "
"Féach ar [ball drag_to_rearrange_enabled]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a tab's right button is pressed. See [method "
"set_tab_button_icon]."
msgstr ""
"Astaithe nuair a bhrúitear cnaipe ceart cluaisín. Féach ar [method "
"set_tab_button_icon]."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Emitted when switching to another tab."
msgstr "Astaítear nuair a aistrítear go cluaisín eile."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml doc/classes/TabContainer.xml
msgid "Emitted when a tab is clicked, even if it is the current tab."
msgstr ""
"Astaítear nuair a chliceáiltear cluaisín, fiú más é an cluaisín reatha é."

#: doc/classes/TabBar.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Emitted when a tab's close button is pressed or, if [member "
"close_with_middle_mouse] is [code]true[/code], when middle-clicking on a "
"tab.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Tabs are not removed automatically; this behavior needs to be "
"coded manually. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"$TabBar.tab_close_pressed.connect($TabBar.remove_tab)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetNode<TabBar>(\"TabBar\").TabClosePressed += "
"GetNode<TabBar>(\"TabBar\").RemoveTab;\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Astaítear nuair a bhrúitear cnaipe gar cluaisín.\n"
"[b]Nóta:[/b] Ní bhaintear cluaisíní go huathoibríoch nuair a bhíonn an "
"cnaipe dúnta brúite, ní mór an t-iompar seo a ríomhchlárú de láimh. Mar "
"shampla:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"$TabBar.tab_close_pressed.connect($TabBar.remove_tab)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetNode<TabBar>(\"TabBar\").TabClosePressed += GetNode "
"<TabBar>(\"TabBar\").RemoveTab;\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

