#: doc/classes/Texture2DArrayRD.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This texture array class allows you to use a 2D array texture created "
"directly on the [RenderingDevice] as a texture for materials, meshes, etc.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Texture2DArrayRD] is intended for low-level usage with "
