msgstr ""
"Déanann sé cill le [CELL_MODE_CUSTOM leanúnach] a thaispeáint mar chnaipe "
"neamhréidh le [StyleBox]."

#: doc/classes/TreeItem.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sets the given column's custom background color and whether to just use it "
"as an outline.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If a custom [StyleBox] is set, the background color will be "
"drawn behind it."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé dath cúlra saincheaptha an cholúin a thugtar agus cé acu is "
