"Níl ann ach le haghaidh comhoiriúnachta. Úsáid [VisualShaderNodeFrame] mar "
"ionadach."

#: modules/visual_shader/doc_classes/VisualShaderNodeComment.xml
msgid ""
"This node was replaced by [VisualShaderNodeFrame] and only exists to "
